# Keep the generic .NET build recipe's source and MSBuild configuration.
*
!global.json
!src/
!src/**
!scaling/
!scaling/src/
!scaling/src/**
!scaling/sample/
!scaling/sample/**

# Generated files, test projects, documentation and local configuration are
# not inputs to the observability application images.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/test/
**/tests/
**/*.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
src/samples/
src/extensions/
src/WorkflowCore.Testing/
